          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala tam adoorihe baraá deeloorí sleémeero aníng kuungá' nu ak hhaamisaaká. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee qoomár mukhúng burnu yaahamiis, tawa kaahi, ‹Ahaá waáy, gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, muruuwí sleémeero ngusa atén i tleéhh a milá?› Kuúng inooín ki beer, ‹Kuungá' aníng ina sié', munguaá dahaaye awa baraá yaamuuhúng kiri sluufmisuú eeré' as adoorí kuungá' xoorór ta xua'aaká kari sagadiyusá' baraá yaamaá xuaawásl wa ale.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
